WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.954 --> 00:00:04.422
OF THE NAVY, A SCATHING CRITIQUE

00:00:04.423 --> 00:00:07.825
FOR HIS OLD BOSS, THE PRESIDENT.

00:00:07.826 --> 00:00:08.826
WE BEGIN WITH CORRESPONDED

00:00:08.827 --> 00:00:10.428
KEVIN CORKE NEAR THE PRESIDENT'S

00:00:10.429 --> 00:00:13.164
FLORIDA RESORT.

00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:14.165
&gt;&gt; CALL IT OPERATIONAL SECURITY,

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:17.201
CALL IT SECRET, BY ANY

00:00:17.202 --> 00:00:18.403
DEFINITION, THE PRESIDENT'S

00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:19.804
VISIT TO AFGHANISTAN WAS A VERY

00:00:19.805 --> 00:00:22.240
WELCOME SURPRISE FOR SOME OF THE

00:00:22.241 --> 00:00:23.174
MANY AMERICAN TROOPS STATIONED

00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:24.642
ABROAD THIS THANKSGIVING

00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:26.277
HOLIDAY.

00:00:26.278 --> 00:00:29.681
&gt;&gt; I HOPE EVERYONE ENJOYED

00:00:29.682 --> 00:00:30.982
THANKSGIVING MEAL.

00:00:30.983 --> 00:00:33.518
&gt;&gt; SOME 50,000 FEET ABOVE THE

00:00:33.519 --> 00:00:34.452
FRIGID WILD BLUE, A WARM WELCOME

00:00:34.453 --> 00:00:38.956
IN AFGHANISTAN.

00:00:38.957 --> 00:00:42.026
&gt;&gt; WE LOVE HIM, WE SAY HAPPY

00:00:42.027 --> 00:00:42.460
THANKSGIVING.

00:00:42.461 --> 00:00:44.962
&gt;&gt; THE SURPRISE TRIP TO SEE U.S.

00:00:44.963 --> 00:00:45.697
SERVICE PERSONNEL THIS HOLIDAY,

00:00:45.698 --> 00:00:49.233
A WELCOME TREAT FOR TROOPS ON A

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:52.970
DAY WE ALL PAUSE TO GIVE THANKS.

00:00:52.971 --> 00:00:54.806
&gt;&gt; MILLIONS OF FAMILIES SIT DOWN

00:00:54.807 --> 00:00:56.307
AT THEIR DINNER TABLES BACK

00:00:56.308 --> 00:00:57.208
HOME, THEY WILL BE SAYING A

00:00:57.209 --> 00:00:59.577
PRAYER FOR THE MEN AND WOMEN

00:00:59.578 --> 00:01:01.612
SERVING OUR NATION IN

00:01:01.613 --> 00:01:03.347
AFGHANISTAN AND DEPLOYED ALL

00:01:03.348 --> 00:01:04.048
AROUND THE GLOBE.

00:01:04.049 --> 00:01:05.983
&gt;&gt; IT WAS IN MANY RESPECTS LIKE

00:01:05.984 --> 00:01:08.820
WHAT WE HAVE SEEN BEFORE, PLENTY

00:01:08.821 --> 00:01:11.222
OF PHOTOS, A BIT OF GOOD-NATURED

00:01:11.223 --> 00:01:13.658
BANTER AND SERVICED BY THE

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:14.192
COMMANDER IN CHIEF.

00:01:14.193 --> 00:01:16.127
TO THOSE WHO IN BEING HERE HAVE

00:01:16.128 --> 00:01:17.929
ALREADY SACRIFICED SO MUCH.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.363
HIS REMARKS HAD ON FAMILIAR

00:01:19.364 --> 00:01:22.066
THEMES TOO, A STRONGER THAN EVER

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:23.134
MILITARY, THE REMOVAL OF

00:01:23.135 --> 00:01:23.868
TERRORISTS FROM THE BATTLEFIELD

00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:27.672
AND THE LIKE.

00:01:27.673 --> 00:01:29.774
HE USED HIS TRIP TO MEET HIS

00:01:29.775 --> 00:01:30.374
PRESIDENTIAL COUNTERPART

00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:32.577
ANNOUNCING THE U.S. AND TALIBAN

00:01:32.578 --> 00:01:34.278
HAVE RESTARTED PEACE TALKS WITH

00:01:34.279 --> 00:01:35.213
THE U.S. INSISTING ON A

00:01:35.214 --> 00:01:35.646
CEASE-FIRE.

00:01:35.647 --> 00:01:37.215
&gt;&gt; THE TELE- BAND WANTS TO MAKE

00:01:37.216 --> 00:01:39.984
A DEAL AND WE ARE MEETING WITH

00:01:39.985 --> 00:01:40.952
THEM AND WE ARE SAYING IT HAS TO

00:01:40.953 --> 00:01:44.188
BE A CEASE-FIRE, THEY DIDN'T

00:01:44.189 --> 00:01:45.289
WANT TO DO A CEASE-FIRE BUT NOW

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.792
THEY DO WANT TO DO A CEASE-FIRE.

00:01:47.793 --> 00:01:50.027
&gt;&gt; THIS AFTER THE U.S. WITHDREW

00:01:50.028 --> 00:01:50.862
FROM PEACE TALKS IN SEPTEMBER

00:01:50.863 --> 00:01:52.630
AND THE PRESIDENT SAID HE'S

00:01:52.631 --> 00:01:54.031
FOLLOWING THROUGH WITH HIS

00:01:54.032 --> 00:01:55.600
CAMPAIGN PROMISES TO DRAW DOWN

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:57.168
AMERICAN TROOP LEVELS

00:01:57.169 --> 00:02:00.071
SUBSTANTIALLY TO ABOUT 8600.

00:02:00.072 --> 00:02:01.139
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE NUMBER OF PEOPLE

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:04.408
ARE TALKING ABOUT, YES.

00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:05.076
[REPORTER QUESTIONING]

00:02:05.077 --> 00:02:08.446
&gt;&gt; IT IS FOR NOW, WE CAN GO MUCH

00:02:08.447 --> 00:02:08.980
FURTHER THAN THAT.

00:02:08.981 --> 00:02:11.249
&gt;&gt; KEENLY AWARE THAT THE FUTURE

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.451
WILL FEND FOR ITSELF, THIS WAS A

00:02:13.452 --> 00:02:15.453
DAY TO REMAIN VERY MUCH IN THE

00:02:15.454 --> 00:02:17.688
PRESENT, A CHANCE TO CAP A

00:02:17.689 --> 00:02:19.590
JOURNEY SHROUDED IN SECRECY,

00:02:19.591 --> 00:02:21.225
WITH A VERY PUBLIC DECLARATION

00:02:21.226 --> 00:02:21.626
OF SUPPORT.

00:02:21.627 --> 00:02:23.761
&gt;&gt; THERE'S NO WHERE I WOULD

00:02:23.762 --> 00:02:24.328
RATHER CELEBRATE THIS

00:02:24.329 --> 00:02:25.596
THANKSGIVING THEN RIGHT HERE

00:02:25.597 --> 00:02:27.365
WITH THE TOUGHEST, STRONGEST,

00:02:27.366 --> 00:02:28.132
BEST, AND BRAVEST WARRIORS ON

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:32.403
THE FACE OF THE EARTH.

00:02:32.404 --> 00:02:35.840
&gt;&gt; RIGHT NOW BETWEEN 12 AND

00:02:35.841 --> 00:02:37.642
13,000, THAT'S DOWN A COUPLE OF

00:02:37.643 --> 00:02:39.076
THOUSAND FROM THIS TIME A YEAR

00:02:39.077 --> 00:02:40.678
AGO, THE PRESIDENT MAKING VERY

00:02:40.679 --> 00:02:43.882
CLEAR THAT THE U.S. WILL REMAIN

